  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nr + (64)/(r) = 16\n\n**Calculations:**\n\nr + (64)/(r) = 16\n\n⇒ r² + 64 = 16r\n\n⇒ r2 - 16r + 64 = 0\n\n⇒ r2 - 8r - 8r + 64 = 0\n\n⇒ r(r - 8) - 8(r - 8) = 0\n\n⇒ (r - 8)(r - 8) = 0\n\n⇒ r = 8\n\nNow, the value of\n\n⇒ r4 + (1)/({{r³)}} \n\n⇒ (8)⁴ + (1)/(8³)\n\n⇒ 4096 + (1)/(512)\n\n⇒ 4096(1)/(512)\n\n**therefore The Required value is 4096(1)/(512).**",
